<section class="policy-section">
    <div class="auto-container">
        <div class="sec-title centered">
            <div class="sec-title_title">Legal</div>
            <h2 class="sec-title_heading">Program Booking <span>Terms</span></h2>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-card">
            <h4>1. Registrations and Eligibility</h4>
            <p>Parents/guardians must provide accurate participant details during registration. iLearningHubb may
                request additional information to complete eligibility and safety checks before confirmation.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-card">
            <h4>2. Advance Booking and Priority</h4>
            <p>Advance tour registration/payment places a family in priority processing for upcoming programs. Final
                booking confirmation is completed by our team near the program schedule based on availability and
                suitability.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-card">
            <h4>3. Payment and Communication</h4>
            <p>Program payments are processed through approved payment gateways. Parents are responsible for ensuring
                contact details are valid so confirmations, reminders, and operational updates are received on time.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-card">
            <h4>4. Parent Responsibilities</h4>
            <p>Parents/guardians must disclose relevant medical, behavioral, or support needs honestly and promptly to
                help us maintain a safe environment for all children and staff.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-card">
            <h4>5. Program Conduct and Safety</h4>
            <p>All participants are expected to follow mentor instructions, safety protocols, and program rules.
                iLearningHubb may remove participation where continued attendance risks safety or program integrity.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-card">
            <h4>6. Updates to Terms</h4>
            <p>We may update these terms when operations, legal obligations, or delivery models evolve. Continued use
                of our registration and booking services indicates acceptance of the latest version.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
